online.com/blogs/name-picker-wheel-work-school#breadcrumbs\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/name-picker-wheel-work-school#breadcrumbs\",\n      \"itemListElement\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 1,\n          \"name\": \"Home\",\n          \"item\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 2,\n          \"name\": \"Blog\",\n          \"item\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n          \"position\": 3,\n          \"name\": \"Name Picker Wheel Work School\",\n          \"item\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/name-picker-wheel-work-school\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/name-picker-wheel-work-school#article\",\n      \"headline\": \"10 Smart Ways to Use a Name Picker Wheel at Work or School\",\n      \"description\": \"A name picker wheel is more than a cold-calling tool. Here are 10 practical ways teachers, managers, and teams use one in 2026 to run fairer meetings, better lessons, and more balanced participation.\",\n      \"image\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/eng-team-picker-wheel.webp\",\n      \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-15\",\n      \"dateModified\": \"2026-11-24\",\n      \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/#harman\"\n      },\n      \"publisher\": {\n        \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/#organization\"\n      },\n      \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\n        \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/name-picker-wheel-work-school#webpage\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://spinthewheelsonline.com/blogs/name-picker-wheel-work-school#faq\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Does a name picker wheel give every name a genuinely equal chance?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes, provided every name occupies equal arc space on the wheel. The result comes from a random number generated at the moment of the spin, so each entry's odds match its share of the wheel and are not affected by past spins or entry order.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Can I weight the wheel so some names come up more often?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes. Tap the '+' weight control (1x to 20x) beside any name to widen its slice and boost its odds without cluttering labels—or enable duplicate entries to add extra tickets. All weights remain visible beside each item.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Is a name picker wheel suitable for remote or hybrid meetings?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Yes. Since it runs in any browser with no installation, screen-sharing it during a video call gives remote participants the same live view as everyone in the room.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"} />
