          <li>
            <div class="step-num"></div>
            <div class="step-body">
              <strong>Project it so everyone actually sees it</strong>
              <p>
                The fairness benefit only lands when the whole group watches the
                spin together. In classrooms, put it on the projector in
                fullscreen. In meetings, share your screen or the room display.
                When everyone sees the same spin at the same moment, the result
                feels shared, not just announced.
